{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become immersed in this 100% accurate <strong>first-person simulation</strong> of the modern man\u2019s life in Man Simulator 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be man enough to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/ba2b64c95f8570ef14352c39a224b9d5.avif?t=1771532816\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in a rush of flavours such as Pink Lemonade and Mango Mix. Utilize each vape's unique power up and feel the heady of your dreams. Don't be concerned about the long-term effects and\u00a0<strong>VAPE VAPE VAPE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/6f01327431d0e3f7b9811ae3d80f99bb.poster.avif?t=1771532816\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/6f01327431d0e3f7b9811ae3d80f99bb.webm?t=1771532816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/6f01327431d0e3f7b9811ae3d80f99bb.mp4?t=1771532816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/7d4548d6edb09f981da5f4ff17760e5e.avif?t=1771532816\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a <strong>state of the art sports betting simulation</strong>.\u00a0 Use\u00a0<strong>Advanced Sports Statistics </strong>and <strong>BET BET BET</strong>. Use this information to <strong>hit your parlay</strong> and watch the money rain down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/92add687016cc5da7bc563371154a30e.poster.avif?t=1771532816\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/92add687016cc5da7bc563371154a30e.webm?t=1771532816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/92add687016cc5da7bc563371154a30e.mp4?t=1771532816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/74d67001d8729631581d54b07219085b.avif?t=1771532816\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live exclusively off food delivered to your home in a brown paper bag. Burgers, fries, and soda will keep you in great health, providing various multipliers to your payouts. Don't go to the doctor. Don't be concerned for your health. Just <strong>EAT EAT EAT</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/5ea3bdb8c9bd2cd63470451e07ea909b.poster.avif?t=1771532816\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/5ea3bdb8c9bd2cd63470451e07ea909b.webm?t=1771532816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863940/extras/5ea3bdb8c9bd2cd63470451e07ea909b.mp4?t=1771532816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c